Say what earlier runs left behind, and collect what is no longer an answer

Usage: mjutest cache [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --directory <DIR>  The workspace whose configuration bounds the store. The working directory
                         by default
      --gc               Remove what has expired, then the oldest of what is left until the store is
                         under its size
      --export <FILE>    Write every answer this machine holds to FILE, one to a line, for another
                         machine to read
      --import <FILE>    Read answers another machine wrote into this machine's store, holding each
                         to what a run of this one would keep
  -h, --help             Print help
